---
title: "Venalkalam: Bugs and Bullies"
date: 2025-01-01
tags: []
provenance:
  journal: Indelible Literary and Arts Journal
  year: "2025"
---
Me. You. Riding.\
The neighborhood kids too\
on hot summer asphalt

Remember us licking\
our red sugar lips\
from the ice truck pops?

Spotted that blue caterpillar\
green guts oozing on the sidewalk\
you went and touched it!

And those spaghetti strap girls\
blowing pink gum bubbles\
calling me brown and ugly

I did not make a face\
did not speak a word but you still looked over\
and told me not to cry

Told me what your bro told you\
Laugh along\
Don't show the hurt

That night we\
caught twelve lightning bugs\
carried them in a jar with leaves and grass

Riding, me and you\
good cool sweat\
Sweet n' salty snack that was
